58:55.754 --> 58:58.798
So a lot of people go up and they leave their foot on the inside.

58:59.279 --> 59:01.361
I need you to bring your foot with your knee.

59:01.842 --> 59:06.609
So we're up, around, down, and then bring it back.

59:07.149 --> 59:11.395
