59:11.375 --> 59:16.825
So these liftoffs, it's going to be good for the glutes, but it's really working it in a shortened range.

59:16.865 --> 59:20.331
So our muscles aren't very strong when they're in that short range.

59:20.632 --> 59:25.461
So this is training them to be stronger and more stable in that short range of motion.

59:25.821 --> 59:29.468
And that's going to help prevent injuries and help explosiveness in the long term.

