01:05:26.936 --> 01:05:40.280
So if you don't have a mini band, you can come back to your pro band and just still go two legs here and here, here and here.

01:05:40.320 --> 01:05:44.127
Of course, afterwards we would have to switch over to the other leg.

01:05:48.646 --> 01:05:49.769
and do the same thing.

01:05:50.150 --> 01:05:53.399
So we're really strengthening up the lateral aspects of the ankle.

01:05:53.439 --> 01:05:55.925
We're working on the arch, the intrinsic muscles of the feet.

01:05:56.206 --> 01:06:02.723
We should feel a burn sort of on the outside of the ankle here and probably a little bit on the top of the foot and in the arch as well.

01:06:13.823 --> 01:06:16.366
So for the DaVinci plank, I'm gonna use a cable machine.

01:06:16.646 --> 01:06:18.828
