01:06:31.060 --> 01:06:32.702
I would really say start very light.

01:06:32.822 --> 01:06:34.283
Start all the way at 30 pounds.

01:06:34.664 --> 01:06:35.825
Try it out, see how it feels.

01:06:35.885 --> 01:06:41.130
