01:06:41.110 --> 01:07:04.722
but so i'm gonna set this up where the cable is in line with my mid chest now i'm just going to step out i'm going to pick it up take a step out i'm in this wide stance my chest is right over my pelvis so i'm not leaning shoulders nice and flat now from there i'm going to lift up this outside foot so i'm going to lift up my left leg about an inch off the ground and i'm just stabilizing so

01:07:04.702 --> 01:07:10.513
I got to stabilize with this right leg, but more importantly, this left side of the core right now is fired up.

01:07:10.894 --> 01:07:12.336
