Don't just let it pull you back in, of course.

01:07:34.481 --> 01:07:37.608
So if we don't have the cable machine, we could use a band.

01:07:37.929 --> 01:07:39.713
I'm using a one inch Perform Better band.

01:07:40.194 --> 01:07:43.241
Hook it up to a tree or to a power rack or something nice and stable.

01:07:43.582 --> 01:07:44.985
I'm gonna pull out

01:07:44.965 --> 01:07:47.892
as far as I can really to get some really good tension on that.

01:07:48.232 --> 01:07:49.876
And then I'm gonna pull that right foot up.

01:07:49.936 --> 01:07:52.683
Of course, that outside foot's always the one that comes up.

01:07:52.703 --> 01:07:53.825
Other arm's straight out.

01:07:54.527 --> 01:07:56.070
And I'm just holding in that position.

