ideally getting my hand pointed up to the ceiling and then I'm coming back down and I'm going the other side this side is a lot harder for most people and we're back down switch to the other side and I'm just gonna rep out there now for a lot of you that's gonna be too difficult off the bat so if that's the case then let's just hold in this position and we'll just go for 25 seconds

