and rapidly and think about putting as much force as you can down into the box on every switch all right we're still going to go with that two second hold so we can get some good isometric strength in the hamstrings which is really going to help with our sprint speed because it's a angle specific just like when uh when we when our feet hit the ground we have that minimal knee bend it's the same knee bend that we have here so we're getting strength

03:07:33.935 --> 03:07:37.242
at the specific angles that's gonna translate to sprinting.

03:07:37.824 --> 03:07:43.416
