03:09:55.313 --> 03:10:00.383
On the line acceleration deceleration drill, we just need a line that's about 15 feet in length.

03:10:01.546 --> 03:10:05.794
If I'm going to my right, my left leg is gonna be my stride leg.

03:10:06.115 --> 03:10:08.941
My right foot is gonna stay on the line every single time.

03:10:09.522 --> 03:10:12.107
So I'm just gonna lift this right foot a little bit,

03:10:12.087 --> 03:10:17.578
stride with that left leg and decelerate pushback as quick as I possibly can.

03:10:18.139 --> 03:10:25.113
So I move over about six inches every time and then I stride that left foot back and I go into my acceleration.

03:10:25.474 --> 03:10:29.843
So it's decel, acceleration, deceleration, acceleration.

03:10:30.143 --> 03:10:31.967
Okay, we're going all the way through.

03:10:31.987 --> 03:10:37.379
Boom, once we reach that line, now we're going left, and my right foot is the stride leg.

03:10:37.740 --> 03:10:44.535
Okay, so left foot lift up, right leg stride decelerate, and accelerate, decelerate, accelerate.

03:10:44.555 --> 03:10:45.317
All right.

03:10:46.276 --> 03:10:51.721
Really treat it like you're going somewhere so that you have some force to absorb and to push back.

03:10:51.801 --> 03:10:53.643
Don't just go through it like this.

03:10:53.943 --> 03:10:59.589
I want you to really lean like you're taking off in your sprint and then catch yourself and push yourself back.

03:11:00.049 --> 03:11:02.551
You gotta think of this ground as a springboard, okay?

03:11:02.591 --> 03:11:05.754
I don't want you to land and sink into your joints.

03:11:06.035 --> 03:11:08.317
I want you to land and push straight back.

03:11:08.397 --> 03:11:10.099
So we gotta have that functional stiffness.

03:11:10.499 --> 03:11:13.802
So as soon as you land, push straight back, okay?

03:11:13.782 --> 03:11:23.228
On this drill, we're really focusing on improving that deceleration time and also getting that explosive acceleration from that back push.

03:11:23.930 --> 03:11:25.875
So we go down, we go back.

03:11:26.196 --> 03:11:27.319
That counts as one rep.

