hit up hit back and then i push forward about a foot with each step so now i'm pushing up boom boom back push up to that next spot okay push up to that next spot so this one we're going for quickness we are not going for distance okay so we're going to stay pretty close to this line and get nice and quick with it okay notice the angle of my foot when i'm going back i'm pointed out

