04:54:29.788 --> 04:54:33.171
This is an opportunity for you to work on your jumping mechanics.

04:54:33.151 --> 04:54:49.759
okay so I just want you to start with a lean so you're gonna kind of start with a lean and then fall into it and then take that recovery step so that's gonna help us build up our acceleration and most of us are probably gonna get three steps so if I was jumping right left

04:54:49.739 --> 04:54:52.724
Then I would lean and I would take a step with my left.

04:54:53.125 --> 04:54:57.112
So then it's left, right, left, take off.

04:54:57.412 --> 04:54:58.554
Now everybody's different.

04:54:58.694 --> 04:55:04.685
Maybe you can get four steps or five steps based on your leg length and your speed.

04:55:04.745 --> 04:55:07.309
