04:55:07.289 --> 04:55:11.955
So after the certain amount of reps with right, left, we're going to go to the other side.

04:55:12.276 --> 04:55:16.181
And then it's lean, fall, right, left, right.

04:55:16.641 --> 04:55:17.943
Get up as high as we can.

04:55:18.524 --> 04:55:21.448
Use this as an opportunity to work on your form.

04:55:21.768 --> 04:55:27.576
And if you can, film yourself or have a friend film you so that you can look at your mechanics afterwards.

04:55:43.520 --> 04:55:47.195
So for our back extension, we're gonna use a regular back extension machine.

04:55:47.275 --> 04:55:50.890
Now, I like to use a band, so I loop a band around the bottom.

04:55:51.191 --> 04:55:52.737
